 60ZN c  2021Or01: {+60}Ga activity was from the decay of {+60}Ge produced via  
 60ZN2c  {+9}Be({+78}Kr,X) with 345 MeV/nucleon {+78}Kr from the RIBF at RIKEN  
 60ZN3c  on a 5 mm {+9}Be target. Fragments were separated, selected and        
 60ZN4c  identified by the BigRIPS separator according to B|r-|DE-tof, and      
 60ZN5c  transported and implanted into the WAS3ABi array consisting of three   
 60ZN6c  DSSSDs at the exit of the ZeroDegree spectrometer. |g rays were        
 60ZN7c  detected with the EURICA array of HPGe detectors. Measured E|g, I|g,   
 60ZN8c  implant-decay time correlations. Deduced parent T{-1/2}, |g emission   
 60ZN9c  probabilities.                                                         
